"id": "17862318444342990", "text": "In “The Fisherman” I explore a range of emotions to tell a story of pain, self-realisation and perseverance. AI is not perfect and it can take a lot trial and error,  but that’s what the same with any medium. One of the biggest challenges with AI is to not break immersion. It’s even more challenging when you’re trying to make a cohesive character display the exact emotions at the right time.\n\nIn a way this story also reflects my own journey as a storyteller. \n\nStay tuned for THE FISHERMAN coming this March \n\n#aivideo #aigenerated #midjourney #klingai", "timestamp": 1739118740, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DF2802Sv0ZA/", "webpage_url_basename": "DF2802Sv0ZA", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.75761-15/476280797_17855071149381227_2212640504861639686_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=MzU2NDMwMzY2OTYxMDM2NjUyODE3ODU1MDcxMTQzMzgxMjI3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjQ2MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=cINVo_pgNcMQ7kNvwEI_xgt&_nc_oc=AdoRzmxuTBMeZxkhf4RSVhznHUuR7sf66a3iQbiZmX_6qsVIob0eYqnNF_cyNcbep8IJHdFVaNgBnEQTRN_J0IQJ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=6Wl0mgfAihw_wu2bSOdleg&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQTRtbxkvUXZZIDKp2GbOwMXaKorO1x1SClFWHZO2QfpyQ&oe=6AF8233A", "display_id": "DF2802Sv0ZA", "fulltitle": "Video by visionmachina", "upload_date": "20250209", "epoch": 1794269367, "format": "dash-1692931799140383v - 1276x718 (DASH video)+dash-649331517618743a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-1692931799140383v+dash-649331517618743a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 595.5659999999999, "width": 1276, "height": 718, "resolution": "1276x718", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "avc1.64001f", "vbr": 533.132, "